      <!-- Right: Accordion -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-3">

        <details class="group bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-border/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors duration-200" open data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.05s">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">How does WAStays work for hotels?</span>
            <span class="flex-none w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5">
            <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">WAStays gives hotels a WhatsApp-first guest journey with direct booking support, pre-check-in flows, and a web dashboard to manage daily operations in one place.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-border/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors duration-200" data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.1s">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Do guests need to download anything new?</span>
            <span class="flex-none w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5">
            <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">No. Guests use WhatsApp, so there is no separate hotel app to download for the core experience.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-border/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors duration-200" data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.15s">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Can guests book and complete pre-check-in through WAStays?</span>
            <span class="flex-none w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5">
            <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Yes. WAStays supports booking quote flows and pre-check-in links, so guests can confirm and complete key pre-arrival steps with less manual follow-up.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-border/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors duration-200" data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.2s">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">How does pricing work for hotels?</span>
            <span class="flex-none w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5">
            <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">There is no monthly subscription. WAStays uses a margin or commission model tied to confirmed bookings.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-border/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors duration-200" data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.25s">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">How long does setup take?</span>
            <span class="flex-none w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5">
            <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Setup is straightforward. Hotels complete their profile, policies, and room setup, then submit for review before going live. Normally it takes less than a day, including integration with official WhatsApp API.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-border/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors duration-200" data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.3s">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Do I need special software to manage WAStays?</span>
            <span class="flex-none w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5">
            <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">No. Hotel teams manage everything from the web dashboard, including bookings, room setup, inventory work, guest records, reports, and settings.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-border/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors duration-200" data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.35s">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Can I use WAStays for more than one property?</span>
            <span class="flex-none w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5">
            <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Yes, if your account has access to multiple hotels. Each property keeps its own setup, and access follows your team's assigned permissions.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[#fdfbf7] border border-border/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors duration-200" data-animate style="transition-delay: 0.4s">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4 px-6 py-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">What happens after a hotel signs up?</span>
            <span class="flex-none w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary/8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-5">
            <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">After sign-up, the hotel completes onboarding, submits for review, and goes live once approved.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

      </div>
